<title>USA: Citicorp installs faster ATMs.</title>
<headline>Citicorp installs faster ATMs.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Citicorp is installing new, faster automated teller machines (ATMs), executive vice president William Campbell told analysts Tuesday.</p>
<p>He said the new machines are 40 percent faster than existing models.</p>
<p>Campbell, who heads consumer banking, said 283 of the machines have been installed in the New York City area. He said the goal is to have the new machines in 100 percent of its ATM locations by 1998.</p>
</text>
